  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A dual-ended brush that applies both creams and powders to the small areas of your face, sculpting and blending with ease for a softly defined look.<br><b><br>Brush Formulation:</b> All Formulas<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic & Natural Blend<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The perfect tool to add soft definition to your nose, eyelids, and anywhere else fine contouring is required, this dual-ended brush allows you to apply any formula you like, sculpting and shaping with artistic precision.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Use the angled end to apply cream and to shape and define. <br>-Use fluffy end to set, blend, and bronze where desired.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Cruelty-Free, Vegan, Synthetic Bristles / Fibers</div></details>",
